  "prefLabel": "Lot 8101.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 8101.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to establish the application procedures, operational requirements, and duties of individuals, organizations, associations, or corporations seeking to obtain a license to conduct advance deposit wagering in the state of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #14448, eff 12-3-25, EXPIRES: 12-3-35",
